{"title":"Process limits","description":"Set how many copies of each external program run at once and how long each may run on a self-hosted Stirling PDF server.","unlisted":false,"space":"server","layout":"","article":"<a class=\"doc-space\" data-accent=\"server\" href=\"/Server/\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 6.5h.01M7 17.5h.01\"/></svg><span>Self-hosted server</span></a>\n    <h1>Process limits</h1>\n<p>Some tools run external programs such as LibreOffice, Tesseract or Ghostscript. For each program you can set:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Session limit</strong>: how many copies run at once. Extra jobs wait in a queue.</li>\n<li><strong>Timeout</strong>: how many minutes one run may take before it is stopped and returns an error.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Change them under <strong>Settings → Server → Advanced → Process Executor Limits</strong>, or under <code>processExecutor</code> in <code>settings.yml</code>. A value of <code>0</code> or less uses the default. Restart Stirling PDF after editing the file.</p>\n<h2 id=\"session-limits\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Session limits<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#session-limits\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Setting</th>\n<th>Default</th>\n<th>Used for</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>libreOfficeSessionLimit</code></td>\n<td><code>1</code></td>\n<td>Office documents to and from PDF</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tesseractSessionLimit</code></td>\n<td><code>1</code></td>\n<td>OCR with Tesseract</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ocrMyPdfSessionLimit</code></td>\n<td><code>2</code></td>\n<td>OCR with OCRmyPDF</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pdfToHtmlSessionLimit</code></td>\n<td><code>1</code></td>\n<td>PDF to HTML and Markdown</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ghostscriptSessionLimit</code></td>\n<td><code>8</code></td>\n<td>Compression, repair and other Ghostscript tools</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>qpdfSessionLimit</code></td>\n<td><code>4</code> in <code>settings.yml</code>, <code>2</code> if unset</td>\n<td>PDF/A conversion, repair and compression</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>imageMagickSessionLimit</code></td>\n<td><code>4</code></td>\n<td>Line-art conversion in Compress</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pythonOpenCvSessionLimit</code></td>\n<td><code>8</code></td>\n<td>Image processing, such as scan extraction</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>weasyPrintSessionLimit</code></td>\n<td><code>16</code></td>\n<td>HTML to PDF</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>calibreSessionLimit</code></td>\n<td><code>1</code></td>\n<td>E-book conversion</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>installAppSessionLimit</code></td>\n<td><code>1</code></td>\n<td>Internal install tasks</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Raise limits on a large server with many users. Lower them on a small one: each copy uses its own memory and CPU, and LibreOffice is especially memory-hungry. For more LibreOffice capacity, see <a href=\"/Server/Operations/LibreOffice/\">LibreOffice parallel processing</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"timeouts\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Timeouts<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#timeouts\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><p>All timeouts are in minutes and default to <code>30</code>, except <code>pdfToHtmltimeoutMinutes</code> (<code>20</code>) and <code>installApptimeoutMinutes</code> (<code>60</code>). The keys in <code>settings.yml</code> are:</p>\n<p><code>libreOfficetimeoutMinutes</code>, <code>pdfToHtmltimeoutMinutes</code>, <code>pythonOpenCvtimeoutMinutes</code>, <code>weasyPrinttimeoutMinutes</code>, <code>installApptimeoutMinutes</code>, <code>calibretimeoutMinutes</code>, <code>imageMagickTimeoutMinutes</code>, <code>tesseractTimeoutMinutes</code>, <code>qpdfTimeoutMinutes</code>, <code>ghostscriptTimeoutMinutes</code> and <code>ocrMyPdfTimeoutMinutes</code>.</p>\n<p>Frequent timeouts usually mean the server is short of CPU or memory.</p>\n<h2 id=\"example\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Example<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#example\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><p>A small, low-memory server:</p>\n<div class=\"tabs\" data-group=\"config-methods\" data-sync=\"true\" id=\"tabs-0\"><div class=\"tab-list\" role=\"tablist\"><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn active\" data-value=\"settings\" aria-selected=\"true\">Settings File</button><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-value=\"env\" aria-selected=\"false\">Environment Variable</button><button role=\"tab\" class=\"tab-btn\" data-value=\"docker-compose\" aria-selected=\"false\">Docker Compose</button></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel active\" data-value=\"settings\">\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">yaml</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">processExecutor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  sessionLimit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    libreOfficeSessionLimit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    tesseractSessionLimit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    ghostscriptSessionLimit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    imageMagickSessionLimit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    pythonOpenCvSessionLimit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    weasyPrintSessionLimit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    qpdfSessionLimit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    ocrMyPdfSessionLimit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  timeoutMinutes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    libreOfficetimeoutMinutes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    tesseractTimeoutMinutes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</div>\n<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-value=\"env\">\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PROCESSEXECUTOR_SESSIONLIMIT_LIBREOFFICESESSIONLIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PROCESSEXECUTOR_SESSIONLIMIT_TESSERACTSESSIONLIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PROCESSEXECUTOR_SESSIONLIMIT_GHOSTSCRIPTSESSIONLIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PROCESSEXECUTOR_SESSIONLIMIT_IMAGEMAGICKSESSIONLIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PROCESSEXECUTOR_SESSIONLIMIT_PYTHONOPENCVSESSIONLIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PROCESSEXECUTOR_SESSIONLIMIT_WEASYPRINTSESSIONLIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PROCESSEXECUTOR_SESSIONLIMIT_QPDFSESSIONLIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PROCESSEXECUTOR_SESSIONLIMIT_OCRMYPDFSESSIONLIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PROCESSEXECUTOR_TIMEOUTMINUTES_LIBREOFFICETIMEOUTMINUTES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PROCESSEXECUTOR_TIMEOUTMINUTES_TESSERACTTIMEOUTMINUTES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">15</span></span></code></pre></div>\n</div>\n<div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-value=\"docker-compose\">\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock-head\"><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">yaml</span><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  stirling-pdf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      PROCESSEXECUTOR_SESSIONLIMIT_LIBREOFFICESESSIONLIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      PROCESSEXECUTOR_SESSIONLIMIT_TESSERACTSESSIONLIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      PROCESSEXECUTOR_SESSIONLIMIT_GHOSTSCRIPTSESSIONLIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      PROCESSEXECUTOR_SESSIONLIMIT_IMAGEMAGICKSESSIONLIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      PROCESSEXECUTOR_SESSIONLIMIT_PYTHONOPENCVSESSIONLIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"